    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized BBTTCC ancestry.</strong> This item keeps the original species UUID while fitting the ancestry-root layer of the new identity stack.</p><p><strong>Qliph-Scarred.</strong> You walked out of a place that should have unmade you. The hollows and fractures in your soul never fully closed, and the world can feel the pressure leaking out.</p><hr /><p><em><strong>Qliph-Scarred Traits</strong></em></p><ul><li><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Qliph-Scarred).</li><li><strong>Size.</strong> You are Medium.</li><li><strong>Speed.</strong> Your walking speed is 30 feet.</li><li><strong>attribute.</strong> Your background determines your attribute increases; Qliph-Scarred does not grant any attribute bonuses.</li></ul><p>Your Qliph-Scarred heritage grants you additional features through advancements (Item Grants) added during character creation.</p>",
